# Wave W17-N (Mt. Smokestack): smoke sand — summit-road pale ash-sand: the road sand itself half ash, grey-pale and soft-treading under the smoking sky (design-authorised: a clear connected path of pale sand running end to end across the summit). The palest, greyest road in the tranche — split from Route 112’s warm chimney sand by value and temperature.
